This license covers the source code in this repository.

It does NOT cover two other kinds of file distributed here:

1. The fonts under src/doc_redact/fonts/, which keep their own licenses (SIL
   OFL, Apache 2.0, GUST, Bitstream, DejaVu). See src/doc_redact/fonts/FONTS.txt
   and the per-font LICENSE files beside it.

2. The document images under figures/, which are pages of RVL-CDIP and through
   it of the Legacy Tobacco Documents Library. RVL-CDIP gives no license of its
   own and refers to the Library's terms:
   https://www.industrydocuments.ucsf.edu/help/copyright/
   Those terms apply to the page images here. They are reproduced to illustrate
   what the tool does; the regions replaced in them are not personal data.
